WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
Open the baggage details for the Newark–Athens fare.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.708
On this itinerary, the first bag is $90 and the second is $120.

3
00:00:01.708 --> 00:00:02.708
Ask Beside at checkout.

4
00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:04.708
The packing list puts one suitcase at about 14.5 kg.

5
00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:06.125
The Athens packing note lists a large suitcase, four T-shirts, two pairs of jeans and two hoodies.

6
00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.042
The suitcase actually weighs 21.5 kg.

7
00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:10.125
21.5 kg leaves 1.5 kg to spare. Skip the $120 second bag.

8
00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:10.833
Return to checkout with the decision made.
